                                 <div class="modal-slider-item">
                                    							
                                    <div class="modal-slider-item__inner">
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									<img class="modal-slider-item__img" src="/_resources/images/campus-locations/hero-granite-falls-campus.webp" alt="Granite Falls Campus Front Building Image">
                                          								</div>
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									
                                          <p>Welcome to the Granite Falls Campus. Our beautiful campus offers small class sizes
                                             and hands-on learning. Explore our state-of-the-art indoor and outdoor facilities
                                             tailored for powerline studies, medical research, energy exploration, and educational
                                             experimentation. With our diverse range of programs, you are sure to find a fit for
                                             you!</p>
                                          									<a href="/about-us/campus-locations/granite-falls-campus.php" class="cta cta--link">Learn More</a>
                                          								</div>
                                       							</div>
                                    						</div>
                                 						
                                 <div class="modal-slider-item">
                                    							
                                    <div class="modal-slider-item__inner">
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									<img class="modal-slider-item__img" src="/_resources/images/campus-locations/hero-marshall-center.webp" alt="Marshall Merit Center Aerial Image">
                                          								</div>
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									
                                          <p>Welcome to the Marshall Merit Center. Home to our Customized Training Programs. The
                                             MERIT (Minnesota Emergency Response &amp; Industry Training) Center is a 53-acre, state-of-the-art,
                                             regional fire and rescue training facility. The facility is owned by the city of Marshall
                                             and operated by Minnesota West. Offering a wide variety of training opportunities
                                             to both municipal emergency responders as well as private industrial emergency responders.</p>
                                          									<a href="/about-us/campus-locations/marshall-center.php" class="cta cta--link">Learn More</a>
                                          								</div>
                                       							</div>
                                    						</div>
                                 						
                                 <div class="modal-slider-item">
                                    							
                                    <div class="modal-slider-item__inner">
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									<img class="modal-slider-item__img" src="/_resources/images/campus-locations/hero-pipestone-campus.webp" alt="Pipestone Campus Aerial Image">
                                          								</div>
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									
                                          <p>Welcome to the Pipestone Campus, where your career journey begins! Our state-of-the-art
                                             program labs are outfitted with industry-standard equipment and tools, ensuring hands-on
                                             learning and real-world preparation. Feel at home with small class sizes and personalized
                                             attention.</p>
                                          									<a href="/about-us/campus-locations/pipestone-campus.php" class="cta cta--link">Learn More</a>
                                          								</div>
                                       							</div>
                                    						</div>
                                 						
                                 <div class="modal-slider-item">
                                    							
                                    <div class="modal-slider-item__inner">
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									<img class="modal-slider-item__img" src="/_resources/images/campus-locations/hero-jackson-campus.webp" alt="Jackson Campus Front Building Image">
                                          								</div>
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									
                                          <p>Welcome to the Jackson campus! Our campus prides itself on technical programs. We
                                             teach you hands-on skills that prepare you for a job in the industry after graduation.
                                             Our facility is built for learning. With innovative technology and modern equipment,
                                             we train you for your future.</p>
                                          									<a href="/about-us/campus-locations/jackson-campus.php" class="cta cta--link">Learn More</a>
                                          								</div>
                                       							</div>
                                    						</div>
                                 						
                                 <div class="modal-slider-item">
                                    							
                                    <div class="modal-slider-item__inner">
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									<img class="modal-slider-item__img" src="/_resources/images/campus-locations/hero-luverne-center.jpg" alt="Luverne Center Front Building Image">
                                          								</div>
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									
                                          <p>Welcome to the Luverne Center. Home to Allied Health programs! What better way to
                                             prepare for your career in healthcare than at a facility that was previously a hospital.
                                             This educational opportunity is made possible by a joint effort between Minnesota
                                             West, Sanford Health Systems, and the City of Luverne. The center is set up with hospital
                                             and clinical standards that allow you to learn in a real-world setting.</p>
                                          									<a href="/about-us/campus-locations/luverne-center.php" class="cta cta--link">Learn More</a>
                                          								</div>
                                       							</div>
                                    						</div>
                                 						
                                 <div class="modal-slider-item">
                                    							
                                    <div class="modal-slider-item__inner">
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									<img class="modal-slider-item__img" src="/_resources/images/campus-locations/hero-worthington-campus.jpg" alt="Worthington Campus Aerial Image">
                                          								</div>
                                       								
                                       <div class="modal-slider-item__col">
                                          									
                                          <p>Welcome to the Worthington Campus, an excellent starting point for your college education!
                                             Immerse yourself in our vibrant community filled with diversity, clubs, and athletics.
                                             We are home to the Minnesota West Bluejays and Ladyjays athletic teams. Explore a
                                             wide array of Liberal Arts classes and programs tailored to your interests. Experience
                                             a learning environment focused on each student's journey.</p>
                                          									<a href="/about-us/campus-locations/worthington-campus.php" class="cta cta--link">Learn More</a>
                                          								</div>
                                       							</div>
                                    						</div>
                                 					</div>
                              				</div>
                           			</div>
                        		</div>
                     	</div>
                  </section>
               
               </div>
         </div>
      </main>
